{"version":1,"content":"<p>任賢齊（小齊）的「齊跡2026」巡迴演唱會由年初開始，先後在上海，泉州、大同及汕頭開騷，昨晚（24日）去到澳門站，小齊和團隊開騷前舉行拜神儀式盼演出順利，眾人切乳豬時大叫：「由頭好到尾﹗」</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T07:58:05.352259+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":94,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T04:50:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T08:38:05.787599+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T07:51:13.798660+00:00","content_hash":"692cb8b265a7bbd1377d82fbd4ebdf05cd17f9190a920216e4b0a183a320d276","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}